+/*
+ * There is no fork() here (Linux compiled to WebAssembly has no MMU), so the backend is this
+ * program again: the same arguments, and BACKEND_ENV in its environment, which makes it take
+ * the forked child's side in main(). It works the same things out from them as we did up to
